    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d146">

                <pb facs="0240" n="166" sameAs="frus:frus1866p1/pg166"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Adams</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1820.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-07-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 30, 1866</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I transmit herewith, for your information,
                    a copy of the President message to the House of Representatives, together with
                    copies of the documents which accompanied it, in answer to two resolutions of
                    the House of the 23d instant, in regard to the disposition of the Fenian
                    prisoners.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <p rendition="#right">WILLIAM H. SEWARD</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Francis Adams,</hi> Esq., <hi
                        rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                <pb facs="0241" n="167" xml:id="pg167"/>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">To the House of Representatives</hi>:</p>
                <p>In answer to two resolutions of the House of Representatives of the 23d instant,
                    in the following words:</p>
                <p>“<hi rendition="#italic">Resolved,</hi> That the House of Representatives
                    respectfully request the President of the United States to urge upon the
                    Canadian authorities, and also the British government, the release of the Fenian
                    prisoners recently captured in Canada.</p>
                <p>“<hi rendition="#italic">Resolved,</hi> That this House respectfully request the
                    President to cause the prosecutions instituted in the United States courts
                    against the Fenians to be discontinued, if compatible with the public
                    interests”—</p>
                <p>I transmit a report of the Secretary of State upon the subject, together with the
                    document which accompanied it.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>ANDREW JOHNSON.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-07-26"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 26, 1866.</date></dateline>
                </closer>


